    "markdown": "![Hugging Face's logo](https://huggingface.co/front/assets/huggingface_logo-noborder.svg) Hugging Face⟨1⟩\n  *  Models ⟨2⟩\n  *  Datasets ⟨3⟩\n  *  Spaces ⟨4⟩\n  *  Buckets new⟨5⟩\n  *  Docs ⟨6⟩\n  *  Enterprise ⟨7⟩\n  * Pricing⟨8⟩\n  *     * Website\n      *  Tasks⟨9⟩\n      *  HuggingChat⟨10⟩\n      *  Collections⟨11⟩\n      *  Languages⟨12⟩\n      *  Organizations⟨13⟩\n    * Community\n      *  Blog⟨14⟩\n      *  Posts⟨15⟩\n      *  Daily Papers⟨16⟩\n      *  Hardware⟨17⟩\n      *  Learn⟨18⟩\n      *  Discord⟨19⟩\n      *  Forum⟨20⟩\n      *  GitHub⟨21⟩\n    * Solutions\n      *  Team & Enterprise⟨7⟩\n      *  Hugging Face PRO⟨22⟩\n      *  Enterprise Support⟨23⟩\n      *  Inference Providers⟨24⟩\n      *  Inference Endpoints⟨25⟩\n      *  Storage Buckets⟨5⟩\n  * * * *\n  * Log In⟨26⟩\n  * Sign Up⟨27⟩\n\n\n#   Datasets:⟨3⟩\n* * *\n ![](https://huggingface.co/avatars/7d57aafa5c1c8a90e2940a652bfec2aa.svg) ⟨28⟩\nVadim067⟨28⟩\n/\ncognitive-matrices-observations⟨29⟩\nlike 0\n Dataset card ⟨29⟩ Files Files and versions xet ⟨30⟩ Community ⟨31⟩\nDataset Viewer\nThe dataset viewer is not available because its heuristics could not detect any supported data files⟨32⟩. You can try uploading⟨33⟩ some data files, or configuring⟨34⟩ the data files location manually.\n**YAML Metadata Warning:** empty or missing yaml metadata in repo card\nCheck out the documentation⟨35⟩ for more information.\n* * *\nlicense: other license_name: other license_link: LICENSE ---SCIENTIFIC AND TECHNICAL DATA ABSTRACT Exclusive Chronological Dataset of Cognitive Matrices and Long-Term Systemic Observations (2010–2026)\n  1. Data Specification and Validation  Asset Type: A continuous 15-year time-series dataset consisting of structured empirical records (141 pages of dense text in Microsoft Word format).   Chronological Accuracy: The dataset is maintained in a strict sequential order. Each control point is logged with the exact month, year, and hour of the observation.   Validation Level: All observations regarding cognitive algorithms and phases of altered states of consciousness (ASC) were conducted by a practicing physician with over 33 years of clinical experience. This ensures medical accuracy of the terminology, rigorous data logging, and a profound understanding of cognitive processes. \n  2. Baseline Data Criteria (Absolute Purity) The primary value of this dataset for training neural networks and calibrating predictive models lies in the complete absence of systemic noise and external distortions:  No external agents affecting cognitive performance were used throughout the entire 15-year research period.   Any use of chemical or pharmaceutical substances, antidepressants, nootropics, stimulants, or other compounds is strictly excluded.   All data was obtained under conditions of absolute biological purity, relying solely on natural neuroplasticity and the clean operation of the brain (a \"clean slate\" approach). \n  3. Technological Value and Applications For research centers, AI laboratories, and predictive analytics specialists, this dataset serves as a foundational asset in the following areas:  Training AI Predictive Models: An exceptional empirical dataset for integration into machine learning algorithms that model subconscious matrices and sleep phases. This data cannot be artificially generated or replicated using chemically altered states of consciousness.   Predictive Analytics Tool: A core dataset for analyzing how signals and markers from borderline cognitive states correlate with and project onto real-world non-linear future processes.   Calibration Systems: A fundamental basis for configuring and testing biomedical systems, as well as researching the hidden potential of clean neural plasticity. \n  4. Interaction Protocol and Synergy Terms Further engagement with the dataset and its author is strictly based on the principles of mutual synergy, absolute confidentiality, and a clear division of roles. The collaboration structure includes:\n  5. Data Licensing / Acquisition: Granting full access to the dataset under closed funding terms that fully ensure the researcher's financial stability and autonomy.\n  6. R&D Funding: Targeted financing to continue the continuous observation program and integrate the findings into the investor's technological platforms.\n  7. Alternative formats of cooperation will not be considered.\n\n\nCopy to bucket new \n\nDownloads last month\n    34\nTotal file size: 5.53 kB\nSystem theme\nCompany\nTOS⟨36⟩ Privacy⟨37⟩ About⟨38⟩ Careers⟨39⟩ ⟨1⟩\nWebsite\nModels⟨2⟩ Datasets⟨3⟩ Spaces⟨4⟩ Pricing⟨8⟩ Docs⟨6⟩\n",
